[][kernel-6.12][common][eth][Update Airoha EN8811H 2.5G PHY upstream driver to v2.0.7]
[Description]
Update Airoha EN8811H 2.5G PHY upstream driver to v2.0.7.

Change Log:
[2026/01/08] v2.0.7
1. Fix CKO function

DTS Example:
========================================================================
&eth {
	...

	gmac2: mac@2 {
		compatible = "mediatek,eth-mac";
		reg = <2>;
		phy-mode = "2500base-x";
		phy-handle = <&phy11>;
	};

	mdio: mdio-bus {
		#address-cells = <1>;
		#size-cells = <0>;

		phy11: phy@11 {
			compatible = "ethernet-phy-id03a2.a411";
			reg = <11>;
			phy-mode = "2500base-x";
			airoha,phy-handle;
		};

		...
	};
};
========================================================================
In addition, if the EN8811H is connected to a RESET GPIO, please check
the GPIO number and add the following properties to the relevant phy node.

reset-gpios = <&pio 48 1>;
reset-assert-us = <10000>;
reset-deassert-us = <10000>;
========================================================================

Note:
* SerDes polarity setting could be configured in dts. Please refer to
the following description.
Tx Reverse, Rx Normal:
		airoha,pnswap-tx;
Tx Normal, Rx Normal:
		There is no need to add pnswap property in the DTS.
Tx Reverse, Rx Reverse:
		airoha,pnswap-tx;
		airoha,pnswap-rx;
Tx Normal, Rx Reverse:
		airoha,pnswap-rx;

* phy-handle setting (for en8811h initialized) could be configured in dts.
Please refer to the following description.
- Work with phy-handle
	Add "airoha,phy-handle" in DTS
- Work with fixed-link
	Do not add "airoha,phy-handle" in DTS

Without this patch, building the kernel module will fail.

